    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär Juda ni Ä-bi-yam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ wäl bädäk runi ruëc Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat, cu Ä-bi-yam a kuäär kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ruëc kɛ run diɔ̱k kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä cɔalkɛ man Maakaa nyaa wutdä mi cɔal i̱ Ä-bi-ca-lom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni dueer diaal tëë ci gua̱n kɛ la̱t nhiamdɛ. Kä /kenɛ lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw ka̱m Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothdɛ, ce̱tkɛ gua̱n ni Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ Dee-bid cu Kuoth Nhial Kuothdɛ jɛ moc kuäär kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cuɛ gatdɛ jak kä kuäär, mi cu Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm jak kä bum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö Dee-bid cɛ la̱t ni cuŋ waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial, /kenɛ rɔ riet gekä kä tëë diaal te cɛ la̱t jɛ kɛ ni̱n teekädɛ diaal, ɛ ni duŋ U-ri-yaa raan Ɣɛ̈th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ni̱n teekä Ä-bi-yam",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ä-bi-yam.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru kɛnɛ tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni cɔalkɛ jɛ i̱ Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " diaal cuɛ tekɛ ko̱r kamdɛ kɛnɛ Ya-rɔ-baam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätnikɛ diaal gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri Juda. Kä cuɛ tekɛ ko̱r kamdɛ kɛnɛ Ya-rɔ-baam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-yam li̱w. Kä cukɛ jɛ kony därwec Dee-bid. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Atha ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär Juda ni Atha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw runi ruëc Ya-rɔ-baam kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, cu Atha a kuäär Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run ti jiɛn ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ kɛl. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Maakaa nya wutdä mi cɔal i̱ Ä-bi-ca-lom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Atha la̱t ni cuŋ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci gua̱n ni Dee-bid ɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tut diaal kɛnɛ ŋut tin la̱tkɛ nyin riärä gua̱thni tin palkɛ guäy thi̱n woc wi̱c, kä cuɛ kuth diaal tin ci gua̱nikɛ la̱t woc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ mandɔŋdɛ ni Maakaa woc kä ɣöö ɛ ciek kua̱r, kɛ ɣöö cɛ kuth Ä-ce-ra täth. Kä cu Atha kuoth mandɔɔŋdɛ da̱k piny kä cuɛ jɛ waŋ rɛy tɔ̱ɔ̱rä Kid-ron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö gua̱th pali kuthni baaŋ /ka̱n kɛ däk. Kä cu Atha lɔcdɛ ka̱m Kuoth Nhial kɛɛliw kɛ ni̱n teekädɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ muc yäcä gua̱n kɛnɛ muc yäcädɛ nööŋ rɛy luak Kuɔth Nhial, da̱a̱p kɛnɛ ciɛk in bo̱r, kɛ kuak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tekɛ ko̱r kam Atha kɛnɛ Bɛ̈ca kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ ni̱n kuäärädiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Bɛ̈ca kuäär thuk duëli kuec caam Juda wä mak, kä cuɛ Rama täth, kɛ ɣöö bɛ thil ram mi bä raar kiɛ wä rɛc kä kuäär Juda ni Atha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Atha da̱a̱p kɛnɛ ciɛk in bo̱r min ci duɔ̱th guäth tɔ̱ɔ̱wä luaak Kuɔth Nhial kɛnɛ duel kua̱r ka̱n kɛɛliw. Kä cuɛ kɛ jäk kä Bɛn-a-dad gat Tɛ̈b-ri-mon, gat Ɣɛdh-ron kuäär Thi-ri-ya, min cieŋ kä Da-math-kɛth, kɛ tet ji̱ kɔaarɛ, wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛ mat te kamdan, ce̱tkɛ mëë te kam guur kɛnɛ gua̱a̱r. Kä nɛnɛ, ɣän ja̱kä ji̱ kä muc dääpä kɛnɛ ciɛk in bo̱r. Wër däk kamdu yɛnɛ Bɛ̈ca kuäär thuk duëli kuec caam, dɔ̱ŋ bɛ ɣä päl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bɛn-a-dad ruac kua̱r ni Atha liŋ, kä cuɛ bo̱o̱th rɛ̈mdɛ ja̱k wëë wi̱i̱ thuk duëli kuec caam mak, kä cuɛ I-yon, kɛ Daan, kɛ A-bel-beth-mä-kaa, kɛ Ki-nä-rɔth kɛɛliw, kɛnɛ mun Nap-ta-li käp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Bɛ̈ca jɛ liŋ, cuɛ ta̱th Rama ka̱p cuɔ̱ŋ, kä cuɛ ciɛŋ ni Ti̱r-dha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ni Atha ruac lat kä Juda, thilɛ ram mi cua päl, cua pääm Rama diaal kɛnɛ jiɛnkɛ kɛ tëë lätkɛ Bɛ̈ca ben deth. Kä cu kuäär ni Atha kɛ lät Gabä wec Ben-ya-min kɛnɛ Midh-pa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätnikɛ diaal, nikɛ buɔ̱mdɛ, nikɛ wec in cɛ täth, gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri Juda. Kä kɛ ni̱n dɔŋädɛ cuɛ tekɛ jiöör ciöknikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony kɛɛl kɛ gua̱ni därwec gua̱n ni Dee-bid. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Na-dab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ rɛw runä ruëc Atha kuäär Juda, cu Na-dab gat Ya-rɔ-baam a kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni dueer waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial, guurɛ ni dueer gua̱n kɛnɛ dueerkɛ tin cɛ jak ni I-thɛ-rɛl kä dui̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
