          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bɛ̈ca gat Ä-ɣi-yaa raan thuɔk duëël Yi-tha-kar, Na-dab ca̱p mi jiäk. Kä cuɛ jɛ näk kä Gi-bɛ-thon wec ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. Kɛ ɣöö Na-dab kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ca Gi-bɛ-thon go̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Bɛ̈ca jɛ näk kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k runi ruëc Atha kuäär Juda, kä cuɛ ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä niɛ min ca kuäär, cuɛ ji̱ dhɔaar Ya-rɔ-baam diaal näk. Cuɛ thil mi cuɛ päl a tëk, amäni mëë cɛ däk, ce̱tnikɛ riet Kuɔth Nhial ëë laarɛ kɛ thok jäŋädɛ ni Ä-ɣi-yaa raan Cilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä Ya-rɔ-baam mëë cɛ la̱t, kä cɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä dui̱r, kä cɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä gak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
